        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-09-04T13:49:26.172Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone!</p>\n<p>Made this account to try and get some help running this RPG for my friends on FoundryVTT, as I was delighted to see that there was a ruleset made with somewhat automated character sheets. However, while most things seem to work, I cannot for the life of me get the dice pool auto rolling to work.</p>\n<p>When I select a power, quality, and status, it is supposed to roll the dice and display them in the chat, however nothing happens no matter what I do. Anyone have this issue and had any luck in fixing it?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>\n<p>EDIT: I managed to solve it by reverting my Foundry game back to the last patch of V11, which seems to have fixed it!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-09-04T17:00:42.178Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
